* text=auto

## Enforce text mode and LF line breaks
*.bat text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.dm text eol=lf
*.dme text eol=lf
*.dmf text eol=lf
*.htm text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf

## Enforce binary mode
*.bmp binary
*.dll binary
*.dmb binary
*.exe binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.so binary

## Merger hooks, run tools/hooks/install.bat or install.sh to set up
*.dmm text eol=lf merge=dmm
*.dmi binary merge=dmi

## Force tab indents on dm files
*.dm whitespace=indent-with-non-tab


## i18n 译文目录：以上游汉化仓 (sernseek) 为唯一源头，合并时永远取上游版本。
## 下游若在这些文件里产生本地改动，合并会整文件冲突（实测 obj.json 5 万行）——
## 而这些文件是工具生成的，本就不该在下游手改：本地内容跑一次
## `bash tools/i18n/resync.sh` 就会重新抽取补回。
##
## ⚠️ merge=theirs **不是** git 内置驱动，只加这一行无效（git 会静默退回默认三方合并）。
## 每个克隆都要执行一次（.git/config 不入库）：
##     git config merge.theirs.name "always take the incoming version"
##     git config merge.theirs.driver "cp -f %B %A"
strings/i18n/** merge=theirs
## 同类的工具生成物散落在 strings/i18n/ 之外，同样只认 sernseek：
## `*.json` 精确匹配到本目录的生成物（en/zh-Hans/prop-templates/policy），
## 不会波及同目录手写的 localize.ts / catalog.ts 等源码。
tgui/packages/tgui/i18n/*.json merge=theirs
tools/i18n/dm_labels.json merge=theirs
# Mark compiled behavior trees as generated files, to avoid clogging up github diff. We have the actual thingy to give a useful BT diff anyways.
build/behavior_trees/**/*.compiled.json linguist-generated
